*** Keywords ***
CB008133_View_Power_Saving_Performance_Management_Counters
    [Documentation]
    ...  Before executing this test case make sure that:
    ...  - the CB008133 feature is activated for the gNB (actNrLBmMimoRTXPowerSaving = True)
    ...  - there is at least one Power Group with Switch Off Method configured as Tx Switch Off (lbpsSOMethod = Tx Switch Off)
    ...
    ...  ARGS:
    ...  :param int cell_id: (Mandatory) : configuration id of NR cell to perform throughput transission and counters check, e.g.: 1
    ...  :param dict throughput: (Mandatory) : dict with throughput and deviation values for each cell identified by
    ...                                        it's nrCellIdentity for NR cells, eutranCellId for LTE cells, wnCelId for WCDMA cells;
    ...                                        defaults to None (L3 call will not be executed).
    ...                                        Example:
    ...                                           {
    ...                                             '827736065':
    ...                                                   {
    ...                                                      'throughput':
    ...                                                          {
    ...                                                              'downlink': '100 Mbits/sec',
    ...                                                              'uplink': '15 Mbits/sec'
    ...                                                          },
    ...                                                      'deviation': '90%'
    ...                                                  },
    ...                                         }
    ...  :param str protocol: (Optional) : data transfer protocol; defaults to UDP.
    ...  :param str udp_buffer: (Optional) : monitoring data buffer; defaults to 4M.
    ...  :param dict ue_network_modes: (Optional) : dictionary with pairs of UE Serial Number - desired network mode e.g. {"SN1234": "NR_only", "SN321": "NR_only}
    ...                                             possible network modes: NR_only, LTE_only, NR_LTE (NR_LTE mode CAN NOT be used with any of the other
    ...                                             two in case of more than one UE); defaults to ${None} (current modes set on UEs will be used)
    ...  :param str measurement_interval: (Optional) : measurement interval defined in minutes, related to single measurement frame duration
    ...                                                set in SCF configuration. One of following values possible to set:
    ...                                                15min, 30min, or 60min, defaults to 15min.

    [Arguments]    ${cell_id}
    ...            ${throughput}
    ...            ${protocol}=udp
    ...            ${udp_buffer}=4M
    ...            ${ue_network_modes}=${None}
    ...            ${measurement_interval}=15min

    [Timeout]      24 hours
    &{required_scf_config_params}=                          Create Dictionary
    ...                                                     mtBtsEnergyMonitoring=${measurement_interval}
    ...                                                     mtSBTSRfmEnergyMonitoring=${measurement_interval}
    ...                                                     mtSBTSSmEnergyMonitoring=${measurement_interval}

    ${bts_type}                                             hwpta_testline.get_type_of_setup
    ${connection}                                           connections.get_default_admin_connection_alias
    ...                                                     bts_type=${bts_type}

    Verify SCF Parameters Responsible For Counters Collection
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     expected_parameters_values_dict=${required_scf_config_params}
    ...                                                     parameters_distname=MRBTS-{}/MNL-1/MNLENT-1/PMMNL-1

    ${counter_ids}                                          Create List
    ...                                                     M55601C02001    M55601C02002

    ${cell_dist_names}                                      admin_info_model.get_dist_names_for_specific_cell
    ...                                                     connection=${connection}
    ...                                                     cell_type=nr
    ...                                                     cell_id=${cell_id}

    ${measurement_interval_in_minutes}                      measurements_timer.convert_time_parameter_from_minutes_format_to_int
    ...                                                     time_parameter=${measurement_interval}
    ${measurement_interval_in_seconds}                      Evaluate
    ...                                                     ${measurement_interval_in_minutes}*60

    ${call_duration}=                                       Evaluate
    ...                                                     ${measurement_interval_in_seconds}*2+30

    Robot Log Operation                                     Starting L3 call with downlink transmission...
    Execute L3 Call In Background                           called_cell=${cell_dist_names['configuration']}
    ...                                                     direction=DL
    ...                                                     duration=${call_duration}s
    ...                                                     throughputs=${throughput}
    ...                                                     protocol=${protocol}
    ...                                                     udp_buffer=${udp_buffer}
    ...                                                     ue_network_modes=${ue_network_modes}
    ...                                                     prepare_cells_to_call=${True}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Waiting up to ${measurement_interval} for a new clear counters frame start...
    ${new_counters_start_time}                              Wait For New Counters Data Frame Generation
    ...                                                     data_frame_interval=${measurement_interval}
    Robot Log Result                                        New clear counters frame starts at ${new_counters_start_time}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Collecting counters '${counter_ids}' with full NRCELL-${cell_id} load.
    ${counters_full_cell_load}                              Wait for End of Current Counters Frame and Collect Counters
    ...                                                     data_frame_interval=${measurement_interval}
    ...                                                     counter_ids=${counter_ids}
    ...                                                     component_name=NRCELL-${cell_id}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Stopping L3 call transmission...
    Stop L3 Call In Background and Disallow Alarms          called_cell=${cell_dist_names['configuration']}
    ...                                                     ignore_error=${True}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Verifing Enegry Saving Counters with full NRCELL-${cell_id} load.
    Verify Energy Saving Counters                           counters_results=${counters_full_cell_load}
    ...                                                     should_be_equal_zero=${True}
    Robot Log Result                                        Verification completed successfully. Counters '${counter_ids}' are equal zero.
    ...                                                     to_console=${True}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Collecting counters '${counter_ids}' without NRCELL-${cell_id} load.
    ${counters_without_cell_load}                           Wait for End of Current Counters Frame and Collect Counters
    ...                                                     data_frame_interval=${measurement_interval}
    ...                                                     counter_ids=${counter_ids}
    ...                                                     component_name=NRCELL-${cell_id}

    Robot Log Operation                                     Verifing Enegry Saving Counters without NRCELL-${cell_id} load.
    Verify Energy Saving Counters                           counters_results=${counters_without_cell_load}
    ...                                                     should_be_equal_zero=${False}
    Robot Log Result                                        Verification completed successfully. Counters '${counter_ids}' are not equal zero.
    ...                                                     to_console=${True}

    [Teardown]    Stop L3 Call In Background and Disallow Alarms
    ...                                                     called_cell=${cell_dist_names['configuration']}
    ...                                                     ignore_error=${True}
